>  severity_tier   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (severity_tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packaging_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'repairable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'total_loss'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_affected    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty_affected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_grade  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (evidence_grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'C'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claimable       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  determined_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 证据与损失事件的关联（多对多，保留选取理由以便复核）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> finding_evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  finding_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss_finding(finding_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evidence_asset(asset_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- proves_damage|proves_timing|proves_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (finding_id, asset_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中 <code>evidence_grade</code> 建议由规则引擎按&quot;是否存在封条照、是否有开箱过程影像、是否有价值单据&quot;三项自动推导，而不是让仓管手填——手填的分级在跨仓对比时没有一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>损失认定要同时成立三个命题：<strong>发生损失、源于运输、量级可算</strong>，它们分别对应状态证据、时点证据、价值证据。只采状态证据是最常见的失败模式。</li>\n<li>破损看使用价值、短少看单据差额、整件丢失看交接链，三者的证据清单与立案时点都不同，不能套用同一张模板。</li>\n<li>封条状态是短少索赔里权重最高也最常被忽略的一项；出库装箱前影像能以极低成本消掉&quot;出厂即有缺陷&quot;的抗辩。</li>\n<li>包装测试规程（如 ISTA 3A / 6-Amazon）是击穿&quot;包装不充分&quot;抗辩的主要依据，没有测试记录就等于把这条抗辩权交给对方。</li>\n<li>证据应内容寻址、只增不改，采集与立案解耦；证据分级应自动推导，用于决定是否提交以及预期回收水平。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>损失事实成立之后，下一个问题立刻出现：这段损伤发生在跨境链路的哪一段？这决定了索赔对象是谁，也是 <a href=\"responsibility-segment-attribute\">责任段与责任方归属</a> 要解决的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"货损与丢件的证据采集与损失界定","id":"货损与丢件的证据采集与损失界定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种损失形态的界定","id":"三种损失形态的界定"},{"level":3,"text":"出厂缺陷与运输损伤的区分","id":"出厂缺陷与运输损伤的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"包装合规性的举证责任","id":"包装合规性的举证责任"},{"level":2,"text":"证据链的采集时点与分工","id":"证据链的采集时点与分工"},{"level":3,"text":"证据的不可抵赖性设计","id":"证据的不可抵赖性设计"},{"level":2,"text":"证据强度的分级与索赔策略","id":"证据强度的分级与索赔策略"},{"level":3,"text":"采集时点的时间轴对齐","id":"采集时点的时间轴对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型与证据落库","id":"数据模型与证据落库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"责任段划分与责任方归属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/loss-damage-determine/responsibility-segment-attribute"}}